# {{title}} {#top}

GEML {{spec}}, reference parser {{parser}}. Seven chapters, each a real
`.geml` file next to this one — **this document writes none of them**. It points
at them, and what you are reading is the result: a tour assembled entirely by
cross-document transclusion, which is itself one of the things being toured.

In the playground, use the chapter bar above to edit any chapter on its own.
Opened as a raw file in the browser extension, the whole tour renders in place.

=== note {.tip #how}
Every reference below is checked when this document is parsed. Press **Break a
reference** and the validity pill flips red — a dangling pointer is never
rendered quietly.
===

